WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.597 --> 00:00:33.990
[sneezes]

2
00:00:42.781 --> 00:00:45.436
[vocalizes fanfare]

3
00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:47.569
["The Other Side" by SZA
and Justin Timberlake playing]

4
00:00:47.612 --> 00:00:50.093
CLOUD GUY: Once upon a time,
there were two Trolls.

5
00:00:50.137 --> 00:00:52.226
-One was named Poppy.
-Hey. How's it going?

6
00:00:52.269 --> 00:00:53.792
CLOUD GUY:
The other was named Branch.

7
00:00:53.836 --> 00:00:55.011
What's up?

8
00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.795
CLOUD GUY: Together, they saved the world.

9
00:00:56.839 --> 00:00:58.275
TROLLS:
Hooray!

10
00:00:58.319 --> 00:00:59.798
CLOUD GUY:
Poppy became queen.

11
00:00:59.842 --> 00:01:01.365
Branch found his true colors.

12
00:01:01.409 --> 00:01:03.628
And the two of them
became best friends.

13
00:01:03.672 --> 00:01:05.761
[imitates fireworks popping]

14
00:01:05.804 --> 00:01:06.762
Boom.

15
00:01:06.805 --> 00:01:07.937
And that was that.

16
00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:09.982
Pretty cute, right?
Not to me.

17
00:01:10.026 --> 00:01:12.637
I'm the type of cloud
that goes for...

18
00:01:12.681 --> 00:01:13.856
this sorta thang.

19
00:01:13.899 --> 00:01:15.292
[dogs barking, yapping]

20
00:01:15.336 --> 00:01:16.554
Mm.

21
00:01:16.598 --> 00:01:18.600
Anyhoo, what Poppy and Branch
didn't know

22
00:01:18.643 --> 00:01:21.733
