a lot bigger than they knew.

23
00:01:21.777 --> 00:01:25.476
Like, a lot, lot, lot,
lot bigger!

24
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:28.305
[whooshing]

25
00:01:28.349 --> 00:01:31.091
-[water burbling]
-[ocean creatures calling]

26
00:01:33.658 --> 00:01:35.878
[heartbeat thumping]

27
00:01:39.664 --> 00:01:41.623
