00:41:34.753 --> 00:41:35.884
No. Why? Are you?

1020
00:41:35.928 --> 00:41:37.364
I just-- I don't know.

1021
00:41:37.407 --> 00:41:38.670
-I don't trust him.
-BIGGIE: Oh, that's good.

1022
00:41:38.713 --> 00:41:39.888
POPPY:
Well, yeah, but you don't

1023
00:41:39.932 --> 00:41:41.237
-trust anybody, Branch.
-[grub squeaking]

1024
00:41:41.281 --> 00:41:43.196
Hey, I just want us to be safe.

1025
00:41:43.239 --> 00:41:44.632
And you know what's not safe?

1026
00:41:44.676 --> 00:41:47.113
