into a complete stranger.

1027
00:41:47.156 --> 00:41:49.245
Oh, I see.

1028
00:41:49.289 --> 00:41:52.118
It's not Hickory
you don't trust. It's me.

1029
00:41:53.075 --> 00:41:54.686
Do you not think
I'm a good queen?

1030
00:41:54.729 --> 00:41:56.557
Wait, what?
I didn't say that.

1031
00:41:56.601 --> 00:41:58.124
I thought we were friends,
Branch.

1032
00:41:58.167 --> 00:41:59.908
I'm starting to think you don't
even know what that means.

1033
00:41:59.952 --> 00:42:01.431
We arefriends.

1034
00:42:01.475 --> 00:42:02.955
And sometimes
that means speaking up

1035
