1047
00:42:42.168 --> 00:42:43.299
[distorted]:
Hello?

1048
00:42:43.343 --> 00:42:45.171
Hello. It's me.

1049
00:42:45.214 --> 00:42:46.172
[laughs]

1050
00:42:46.215 --> 00:42:48.478
Look! Narwhals.

1051
00:42:48.522 --> 00:42:51.481
-POPPY: Totally gnar-gnar.
-[narwhals whistling]

1052
00:42:51.525 --> 00:42:53.571
