Poppy!

1053
00:42:54.833 --> 00:42:56.791
[giggling]

1054
00:42:56.835 --> 00:42:57.836
Oh.

1055
00:43:00.490 --> 00:43:01.448
-[music stops]
-Ah...

1056
00:43:01.491 --> 00:43:02.928
BRANCH:
Poppy,

1057
00:43:02.971 --> 00:43:05.365
how'd you like the sushi?

1058
00:43:05.408 --> 00:43:06.758
-[groaning]
-Oh.

1059
00:43:06.801 --> 00:43:08.673
