breaks a pinky promise?!

1095
00:44:47.293 --> 00:44:49.208
Biggie.

1096
00:44:49.251 --> 00:44:50.644
No.

1097
00:44:52.080 --> 00:44:54.039
[sizzling]

1098
00:44:54.082 --> 00:44:56.302
