1148
00:47:17.573 --> 00:47:19.793
♪ Friend.♪

1149
00:47:21.273 --> 00:47:22.317
It's you.

1150
00:47:22.361 --> 00:47:24.580
Yeah. I got that. Thanks.

1151
00:47:24.624 --> 00:47:26.626
